contentText:
Drake&#8217;s Spanish lessons have paid off. Karol G joined Popcast on Wednesday and raved about Drizzy&#8217;s ability to perform in Spanish on their &#8220;Ahí&#8221; collaboration.

&#8220;I love him singing in Spanish, and he does it so good that when I presented the song to him, he was like, &#8216;Should I do like a verse in English or something?'&#8221; she said. &#8220;And I was like, &#8216;You should do it in Spanish. You sound so good in Spanish.&#8217; [He said], &#8216;Come and make me do it perfectly.'&#8221;

